# Asistente + document status (roadmap)

## Por qué construimos esto

Futura Nota converge a **un solo Asistente** (la “estrella”): texto primero, voz después en tasks chicos. Los multi-agentes actuales se eliminarán. Los ajustes de producto (status ricos, schedule, etc.) preparan **señales semánticas** para que el asistente tome mejores notas — no son features aisladas.

## Schedule / reserva

**Day-first:** schedule is on the **document** only. Folder Start→Finish UI is retired (fields may remain null in data).

| Surface | Behavior |
|---|---|
| Folder | No schedule picker |
| Document (content TEXT/CHECKBOX) | Free date + start (+ finish); no folder clamp |
| Campaign docs | Launch / campaign rules unchanged |

`flexible` classifies docs with **no hours**; selecting it clears any schedule; picking a date removes `flexible`. Clearing the doc date also clears start/finish hours.

Ver `timeline-product-model.mdc`.

## Document status — live subset (folders)

Campo `node.status`: `not_started` | `reserved` | `flexible` | `in_progress` | `submitted` | `past_due` | `completed` | `null`.
`completed: boolean` se deriva (`true` iff `status === "completed"`) para timeline / folder pie.
Legacy `in_review` se migra a `submitted` al hidratar.

**Visibility gate**

| Condition | Status UI on the document |
|---|---|
| No schedule date | **Reserved** + **Flexible** |
| Has schedule date (`anchorAt`) | **All** work statuses |

`reserved` remains a classification for far/non-urgent plan; it is **not** required to unlock the picker. `flexible` = docs without hours.

| Status | Quién lo setea |
|---|---|
| *(null)* | Default al crear (sin schedule completo) |
| `not_started` | Auto al guardar schedule completo (date + start + finish) con status vacío; también manual |
| `reserved` | Manual — plan lejos / sin urgencia |
| `flexible` | Manual — doc sin horario; al elegir fecha se limpia a `null` |
| `in_progress` | Auto **solo** al escribir body durante la ventana horaria del doc (`now ∈ [anchorAt, anchorFinishAt]`) y status es `not_started`; también manual en cualquier momento |
| `submitted` | Manual ahora; el asistente lo seteará al terminar un task (entrega para revisar) |
| `past_due` | Auto cuando `in_progress` + schedule del doc ya pasó; también manual |
| `completed` | Manual (usuario cierra el trabajo) |

Flujo típico: save schedule → `not_started` → (write during window) `in_progress` → (agent) submitted → (user) completed ·· o ·· reserved → in_progress → completed ·· o ·· flexible (sin horas) → fecha → not_started.

Escribir fuera de la ventana horaria **no** cambia el status. Toggle manual siempre permitido.

Auto past_due: `src/lib/docPastDueTransition.js` (tick en `useScheduledAgentRunner`). No convierte `reserved` / `flexible` / `submitted` / `completed` / `not_started`. No exige frame de folder.

Helper: `src/lib/docWorkStatus.js` (`defaultStatusAfterScheduleSave`, `nextStatusOnWriteDuringScheduleWindow`, `sanitizeDocStatusForFolderSchedule` no-op, `shouldShowDocStatusChip`). UI: toggle en `NodeQueryModal`; chips en `FolderDocumentRow` / `LinkedMacronodeDescription`.

## Folder status — inherited by priority

`src/lib/folderStatus.js` → `resolveFolderStatus`:

1. Cualquier child `submitted` → folder **Submitted**
2. Cualquier child `reserved` → folder **Reserved** (también: nunca mostrar Past due en el folder mientras haya reserved)
3. Cualquier child `past_due` → folder **Past due**
4. Cualquier child `in_progress` → folder **In progress**
5. Si todos `completed` → folder **Completed**
6. Else → **Not started** (children `not_started` / `flexible` / `null` no elevan el folder)

Reserved bloquea Completed: 4 completed + 1 reserved → folder Reserved.

**Folder progress %:** `total` = all children; `percent` = closed among children **with** `anchorAt` only (see dual metrics).

## Paleta visual de referencia

Referencia Magic/badge (adaptar a dark `#151515`; SVGs `/uploads`):

| Status | Color ref | Icono | Estado |
|---|---|---|---|
| Not started | `#D6B4A7` | CircleDashed (chip icon + label) | **live** |
| Reserved | `#EAA65D` | pending.svg | **live** |
| Flexible | `#9AA7B8` | CircleDashed | **live** |
| Past due | `#CCCCCC` | ClockCountdown (chip icon + label) | **live** |
| Success / Completed | `#57BC6C` | Checks / completed.svg | **live** |
| In progress | `#008AF5` | CircleDashed | **live** |
| Submitted | `#9675FF` / `#6C3CF0` | submitted.svg (+ submitted-icon) | **live** |
| In review | `#F0B13D` | ScanSearch | retirado (migrado a submitted) |

Folder “Not started” uses the same pink chip as file rows. Label “Submitted” (no “Submited”). Label “Past due” (no “Failed” en UI).

## Reglas

- No activar statuses “por si acaso”. Esperar brief explícito por status.
- Todo-plan ya tiene statuses propios (`TodoStatusIcon`) — no confundir con document status.
- Campaign docs siguen con active/inactive; no mezclar con work status.
